  <p>The visible shape of the prim determines its physics-shape</p>
  <p>default for all non-mesh prims</p>
  <p><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/PRIM_PHYSICS_SHAPE_CONVEX" target="_blank">PRIM_PHYSICS_SHAPE_CONVEX</a></p>
